        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUT THAT WIRE: The combination of a legendary card game and chaotic places.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Cut That Wire. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where every action you take, every game you play, and every wire you cut can lead to instant death. Join the deadly table in the <strong>most chaotic places from Space Station to Vampire Castle!</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Are you a real fan or just lucky? Try new mode: Billionaire or Die!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your friends to see who’s the ultimate fans is from a wide range of categories to choose from, including movies, anime, TV series, music, animals, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/f064dcf4d101550973b53799413e4dfc.poster.avif?t=1770277031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/f064dcf4d101550973b53799413e4dfc.webm?t=1770277031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/f064dcf4d101550973b53799413e4dfc.mp4?t=1770277031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the iconic card game NEW Game “Old Maid”</strong>. Find the Joker and discard the pair and win, or cut that wire and risk instant death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/53620e91b313f4060b2ee6320b2fae99.poster.avif?t=1770277031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/53620e91b313f4060b2ee6320b2fae99.webm?t=1770277031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 Steps - Pick a card - Find the “Old Maid” (Joker) - Avoid the pair - Cut that wire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual but thrilling card game for you and your friend who loves trying your luck with a wire that can decide your fate, whether to survive or fly into space! Solo players are also welcome with a quick match function!.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/5f5c37d0c707e929023f7599aa749188.poster.avif?t=1770277031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/5f5c37d0c707e929023f7599aa749188.webm?t=1770277031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Try the classic Cut That Wire game: Bluff and outsmart the imposter to win.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play along with the games, from Big Bluff Drawing and Big Bluff Picture, while spotting the odd behavior from your friend. An engineer can help avoid the deadly wire, but the imposter does the opposite. If you are having trust issues, this is the game for you. Please be reminded that time is counting. The imposter may try to waste time and let the bomb go off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/36d8f80fab1dd2411f726eca5412de3b.poster.avif?t=1770277031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/36d8f80fab1dd2411f726eca5412de3b.webm?t=1770277031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose the wire carefully.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter what game you choose in Cut That Wire. All you have to do is always cut the right wire or say byeeee!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/53620e91b313f4060b2ee6320b2fae99.poster.avif?t=1770277031\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/53620e91b313f4060b2ee6320b2fae99.webm?t=1770277031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Note: The game requires 3 players to start. <br> <br>I’ve been ejected to space 1,434 times and yet still love to play Old Maid with my friend in the space station.  <br>The game is so great 10/10” - Mr. Guy  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498650/extras/5512c9a081907880bf20e2ede66df78a.avif?t=1770277031\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p>",
